<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>{{#if firstName}}Hi {{firstName}},{{else}}Hello,{{/if}}</p>
<p style='color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;'>Your fleet <strong>{{fleetName}}</strong> has reached its credit limit: {{exposureFormatted}} is open, the limit is {{limitFormatted}}.</p>
<p style='color:#6b7280;line-height:1.6;margin:0;font-size:14px;'>Members cannot start charging on account until the open amount is below the limit. Paying open invoices lets them charge again; contact your operator to change the limit.</p>
